  "description": "Tool that allows to load various types of assets into your BepInEx mod. Made specificly to be used for Baldi's Basics Plus BepInEx modding, but it can be used for any BepInEx plugin you make.\nAble to load Texture2D, AudioClip, Mesh, Sprite, Json, Sprite Sheets, Text files, Cubemaps and Assembly files. (Loads any unknown type as a byte[])\n\nMade by Blayms (https://blayms.github.io/about-me/)\nRead documentation (https://sites.google.com/view/mea-docs/main)",
  "iconFile": "MEAIcon.png",
  "id": "tbb.blayms.mea",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2025-03-16T18:23:45.7Z",
